# OS       TRIPLET                    ARCH          TIMEOUT
macos      x86_64-apple-darwinopt     x86_64        290
macos      aarch64-apple-darwinopt    aarch64       .

# These special lines allow us to embed default values for the columns above.
# Any column without a default mapping here will simply substitute a `.` to the empty string

# Use the regular macOS test timeout.
# The x86_64 override is needed because scheduled builds also run the external
# stdlib tests, and the 4-core Intel testers need up to ~160 min for the full
# suite, close to the 180 min test budget of the default. 290 gives the tests
# 245 min.
#default TIMEOUT 225
